        <monstor_v5:Job_jobDescription>Job Description
Company Description

Bajaj Housing Finance Limited (BHFL), classified as an Upper-Layer NBFC by the RBI, is a subsidiary of Bajaj Finance Limited and caters to more than 88.11 million customers across India. Headquartered in Pune, BHFL offers finance for home and commercial space purchases and renovations, loans against property. The Company is rated AAA/Stable for its long-term debt program and A1+ for its short-term debt program by CRISIL and India Ratings.

Role Description

This is a full-time, on-site Sales Manager role located in Raipur. The Sales Manager will be responsible for overseeing sales activities, developing sales strategies, building and maintaining customer relationships, and achieving sales targets set by the company.

Qualifications

Proven experience in sales management and achieving sales targets
Strong negotiation and communication skills
Customer relationship management skills
Ability to develop and implement sales strategies
Knowledge of financial products and services
Excellent leadership and team management skills
Bachelor&apos;s degree in Business Administration or related field
Relevant certifications in sales management will be a plus</monstor_v5:Job_jobDescription>
